{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-07-10-004", "date": "2026-07-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "[Infographic] Where Culture Meets Innovation: Galaxy Unpacked’s Journey Through Global Cities", "content": "Each summer, Galaxy Unpacked — Samsung Electronics’ mobile device launch event — unveils the next chapter of Galaxy innovation in a different city around the world. Following Seoul in 2023, the event continued to Paris in 2024, Brooklyn in 2025 and now touches down in London. Every destination has given Galaxy Unpacked a distinct identity. […]", "sources": [{"name": "samsung_elec", "url": "https://news.samsung.com/global/infographic-where-culture-meets-innovation-galaxy-unpackeds-journey-through-global-cities", "type": "rss"}]}
